{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slide":7,"text":"PRESENTATION: Explain the four demo states on this slide in about 15 seconds.\n\nSWITCH TO TERMINAL: Run forge script script/Demo.s.sol. Point out the successful payment, the forged-message rejection with zero attacker balance, the authenticated volume spike that latches the breaker, and the guardian clear followed by resumed settlement.\n\nSWITCH TO BROWSER: Open the public guardian dashboard. Make clear that this is the separate live Sepolia deployment, not the local Anvil state. Show the breaker status, guard configuration, and indexed feed if populated. Do not depend on a live latch or wallet transaction.\n\nRETURN TO PRESENTATION: Continue with slide 8.\n\nSource: script/Demo.s.sol, README.md, and docs/deployments.md."}
